<style>
/* K · Cormorant Garamond with Jost. Announcement bar, one-row header. Menus: capital text columns with a photograph flush right. Two buttons under the intro. */
:root{--display:"Cormorant Garamond",Georgia,serif;--sans:"Jost",system-ui,sans-serif}
.logo{font-size:32px;font-weight:600}
.nav{margin-left:clamp(36px,4vw,64px);gap:clamp(18px,2vw,30px)}
.hero-copy h1{font:600 clamp(38px,3.8vw,60px)/1.02 var(--display)}
.hide-d{display:none}
@media (max-width:1080px){.hide-d{display:inline-flex}}
.sp + .ws{padding-top:0}
.sp:has(+ .ws){padding-bottom:clamp(40px,4vw,56px)}
.bh + .sp-size{padding-top:0}
.sp-size + .pv-k{padding-top:0}
.sp-size:has(+ .pv-k){padding-bottom:clamp(40px,4vw,56px)}
.pv-k + .rv{padding-top:clamp(40px,4vw,56px)}
.pv-k + .bd2{padding-top:0}
.bd2 + .rv{padding-top:0}
.rv.r1 .cards{align-items:stretch}
.rv.r1 .cd{border-top:0;padding-top:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:100%}
.rv.r1 .cd .rq{flex:1}
/* one rhythm: every section below the hero sits the same distance apart */
:root{--sec:clamp(56px,6vw,88px)}
main > section:not(.hero):not(.next){padding-top:0!important;padding-bottom:0!important;margin-top:var(--sec)!important;margin-bottom:0!important}
main > section.next{margin-top:var(--sec)}
</style>

<div class="dw"><header class="dw-hero"><div class="dw-w"><nav class="dz-crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">Help</span></nav><h1>Help</h1><p>Everything you need to know about ordering, delivery, returns and looking after your things.</p></div></header><section class="dw-keys"><div class="dw-w"><div><b>Free UK delivery</b><span>On orders over £75</span></div><div><b>Free UK returns</b><span>Within 14 days</span></div><div><b>Worldwide shipping</b><span>To most countries, tracked</span></div></div></section><section class="hb-sec"><div class="dw-w"><h2>How can we help?</h2><div class="hb-boxes"><a href="/pages/delivery"><b>Delivery</b><span>Costs, times, worldwide shipping and what happens if something goes wrong.</span><em>Read more</em></a><a href="/pages/returns"><b>Returns &amp; refunds</b><span>How to send something back, exchanges, refunds and faulty items.</span><em>Read more</em></a><a href="/pages/track-order"><b>Track an order</b><span>Follow your order to your door with your order number and email.</span><em>Read more</em></a><a href="/pages/faqs"><b>FAQs</b><span>Orders, sizing, product care and payments.</span><em>Read more</em></a><a href="{{ routes.account_url }}"><b>Your account</b><span>Orders, addresses and details in one place.</span><em>Read more</em></a><a href="/pages/contact"><b>Contact us</b><span>Talk to a real person, Monday to Friday.</span><em>Read more</em></a></div></div></section><section class="hb-sec"><div class="dw-w hb-two"><div><h2>Popular questions</h2><p>The questions we&rsquo;re asked most. You&rsquo;ll find the rest in our <a href="/pages/faqs">FAQs</a>.</p></div><div class="dw-faq"><details><summary>When will my order arrive?</summary><p>UK standard delivery takes 2 to 4 working days and is free on orders over £75. Express delivery arrives the next working day when you order by 2pm.</p></details><details><summary>Do you ship worldwide?</summary><p>Yes, to most countries. Costs and times for your address are shown at checkout, and any import duties are paid by the recipient.</p></details><details><summary>How do I return something?</summary><p>You have 14 days from delivery to tell us, and another 14 to send it back unworn with its tags. UK returns are free.</p></details><details><summary>What if my order hasn&rsquo;t arrived?</summary><p>Contact us and we&rsquo;ll investigate with the courier straight away. If it can&rsquo;t be found, we&rsquo;ll send a replacement or refund you in full.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change or cancel my order?</summary><p>We can change or cancel an order within an hour of it being placed. Contact us as soon as you can with your order number.</p></details><details><summary>How do I measure my dog?</summary><p>Measure the back from the base of the neck to the base of the tail, the chest around the widest part behind the front legs, and the neck where a collar sits. Every product page has its own size guide.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="hb-sec hb-ct"><div class="dw-w hb-two"><div><h2>Still need help?</h2><p>Our team is here Monday to Friday, 9am to 5pm, and replies to every message within one working day.</p></div><div class="hb-cd"><div><span>Email</span><a href="mailto:hello@axelandhound.co.uk">hello@axelandhound.co.uk</a></div><div><span>Hours</span><p>Monday to Friday, 9am to 5pm</p></div><a class="dw-btn" href="/pages/contact">Contact us</a></div></div></section></div>


